Fix path traversal in read_report (CWE-22)

The report path joined the requested name onto the report directory and
opened the result, so "../" sequences read files outside that directory.
read_report now canonicalises the joined path with os.path.realpath() and
refuses any path that does not start with the report directory before
opening it; the check runs on every path to open, so a traversal cannot
reach the open.
